    "prompt": "TWILIGHT transform:176 경비병(창) 대장: author ONLY 3 missing S DEATH poses. The catalog portrait is identity authority; the additional unchanged legacy atlas establishes exact painted sprite style, small native sprite scale, facing and original hand/equipment. Existing 3 poses are preserved byte-for-byte and must NOT be redrawn: pose82 at final phase0, pose90 at final phase3, pose98 at final phase5. Their atlas coordinates are pose82 source rectangle x456 y490 w93 h135; pose90 source rectangle x451 y707 w101 h101; pose98 source rectangle x449 y863 w98 h99. Create ONE transparent RGBA PNG with EXACTLY 3 equal columns and 1 equal rows, 3 new full-body poses in reading order. Every pose uses the same elevated FRONT view facing screen DOWN; no facing or camera changes. Keep the exact silver-white closed pointed helmet and armor, dark joints, deep dark-purple cape, one original lavender-bladed long polearm, original anatomical weapon hand, body proportions and ornament. Use the small native sprite scale of the preserved atlas, not an enlarged portrait. Keep all bodies, complete polearm blade and butt, hands, feet and cape inside their own cells with generous transparent gutters. Do not replace the original weapon or add a shield, facial skin, wings, tail or extra equipment. NEW CELLS ONLY: cell0: final phase1: knees and hips sink further after preserved death-begin, grip and armor still connected, balance irreversibly failing; cell1: final phase2: actual body fall between collapse-begin and the preserved near-ground falling/impact frame; chest drops and knees fold naturally; cell2: final phase4: ground settling AFTER the preserved fall/impact and BEFORE the preserved final corpse; armor, original cape and polearm physically settle into the final pose. Articulate connected joints and equipment into different real poses; never copy, mirror, rotate, translate, recolor or interpolate a static sprite. No labels, grid, captions, extra figures, scenery, opaque background, ground, shadows, detached effects, large aura or long trails. Alpha-zero outside silhouettes. This is one irreversible fall toward the preserved motionless final corpse, not a bow, kneel, attack or hit recovery. No gore or detached armor/limbs.",
